[00:10.64] Ain't it just like dyin'
[00:13.66] 'Cept you can still feel the same
[00:26.82] All hands on deck now
[00:29.84] The sea is gettin' rough again
[00:42.82] You see him out your window
[00:45.28] Even when you close the blinds
[00:55.74] And all you ever wanted
[01:02.48] Was someone to treat you nice and kind
[01:18.96] Take a step before runnin'
[01:22.20] Take a breath now before you dive
[01:35.62] When you work the streets, darlin'
[01:38.76] Make sure your sneaker laces, they get tied
[01:51.00] I'll be your black bird, darlin'
[01:54.46] Hangin' on your telephone wire
[02:07.46] Flap my wings on it
[02:12.12] And set your heart afire
